CERN OPEN HARDWARE LICENCE Version 2 - Permissive

Preamble

The CERN Open Hardware Licence (CERN-OHL) is a legal instrument designed to
allow people to share, modify, and manufacture hardware designs.

This project is licensed under the CERN-OHL-P v2. The full licence text is
available at:

https://ohwr.org/cern_ohl_p_v2.txt

